## 541.1 最初四阶

$$
\boxed{
m_0=B.
}
\tag{541.7}
$$

$$
\boxed{
m_1
=
B+2uB'.
}
\tag{541.8}
$$

$$
\boxed{
m_2
=
B+8uB'+4u^2B''.
}
\tag{541.9}
$$

$$
\boxed{
m_3
=
B+18uB'
+24u^2B''
+\frac{16}{3}u^3B'''.
}
\tag{541.10}
$$

因此：

$$
\boxed{
\text{全部 Cayley moments}
=
\text{单一 Stieltjes budget curve 的微分 jet}.
}
$$

